<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 184 0 R
/T (This project implements a semantic book recommendation engine using LangChain, HuggingFace embeddings, and Chroma vector store. It enables natural language search where users find books based on description similarity rather than exact keywords. Results are refined through category filtering and sorted by specific emotional tones such as joy, sadness, or suspense. A Gradio-based web interface displays the final recommendations with book covers, authors, and truncated summaries.)
/E (This project implements a semantic book recommendation engine using LangChain, HuggingFace embeddings, and Chroma vector store. It enables natural language search where users find books based on description similarity rather than exact keywords. Results are refined through category filtering and sorted by specific emotional tones such as joy, sadness, or suspense. A Gradio-based web interface displays the final recommendations with book covers, authors, and truncated summaries.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
